OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy through Thursday, 
OL,6,Fwith a few showers initially, mainly   
OL,7,Ftowards the coast. Perhaps the odd     
OL,8,Fbrighter spell during the afternoon.   
OL,9,FChilly with a brisk wind, especially   
OL,10,Ftowards the coast.                     
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy but dry initially      
OL,13,Fovernight with an increasing           
OL,14,Fsoutheasterly wind. Spells of rain,    
OL,15,Fhill snow, and perhaps freezing rain,  
OL,16,Fgradually move east across the region  
OL,17,Ffrom midnight.                         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
