OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CFriday:FA chilly and dull day with     
OL,6,Fstrong winds and occasional rain that  
OL,7,Fmay initially fall as snow or freezing 
OL,8,Frain over the hills. Cold and cloudy   
OL,9,Fovernight with further rain.           
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy 
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of heavy rain on        
OL,13,FSaturday. Becoming brighter by Sunday  
OL,14,Fwith afternoon showers to follow.      
OL,15,FCloudy with a chance of rain on Monday 
OL,16,Fand a strengthening wind.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
